<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">MoCLIP-Lite: Efficient Video Recognition by Fusing CLIP with Motion Vectors<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>This research was conducted with the financial support of Research Ireland under Grant Agreement No. 13/RC/2106_P2 at the ADAPT Centre at University College Dublin. ADAPT, the Research Ireland Centre for AI-Driven Digital Content Technology, is funded through the Research Ireland Centres Programme.</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
